@startuml
' Figure 25.12  The refund loop as an explicit state machine
' Reading order: follow the arrows from intake, snaking down two
' columns through seven states to done; intake and assess are the only states
' that call a model. Permit may decline. Every state but permit may hand
' off to a person. Any transition not drawn is refused.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
hide empty description
state "Intake (model)" as intake <<ops>>
state "Gather" as gather <<ops>>
state "Assess (model)" as assess <<ops>>
state "Propose" as propose <<ops>>
state "Permit" as permit <<policy>>
state "Execute" as execute <<ops>>
state "Verify" as verify <<verified>>
state "Declined" as declined <<policy>>
state "Done" as done <<verified>>
intake -right-> gather
gather -down-> assess
assess -left-> propose
propose -down-> permit
permit -right-> execute
execute -down-> verify
verify -left-> done
permit -down-> declined
@enduml
